    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ălānus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to the Alani</i>, =
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀλανοί</span>, <i>a
				very warlike Scythian nation upon the Tanais and Palus
				Mœotis</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gens Alana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. B. Get. 583</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ălānus</span></b> , i,
				m., <i>one of the Alani</i>, <i><span class="en">Luc. 10,
				454</span></i>.—<i>Com. plur.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ălāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, <i>the Alani</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				4, 12, 25, § 80</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen.
				Thyest. 629</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 8, 223</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Fl.
			642</span></i>.</div>
